    </table>\n                </small>\n\n                <div class=\"subtitle2\">強チェリー・チャンス目成立時</div>\n                <small>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:20%;\">シンジ</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:20%;\">ミサト</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:20%;\">レイ</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:20%;\">アスカ</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>35.16%</td>\n                            <td>28.13%</td>\n                            <td>15.63%</td>\n                            <td>2.34%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>15.63%</td>\n                            <td>10.94%</td>\n                            <td>18.75%</td>\n                            <td>4.69%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>14.06%</td>\n                            <td>10.94%</td>\n                            <td>18.75%</td>\n                            <td>6.25%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>6.25%</td>\n                            <td>18.75%</td>\n                            <td>10.94%</td>\n                            <td>7.81%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>6.25%</td>\n                            <td>10.94%</td>\n                            <td>18.75%</td>\n                            <td>7.81%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th>マリ</th>\n                            <th>ボイス<br>非発生</th>\n                            <th>加持</th>\n                            <th>カヲル</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>18.75%</td>\n                            <td>ー</td>\n                            <td>ー</td>\n                            <td>ー</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>ー</td>\n                            <td>50.00%</td>\n                            <td>ー</td>\n                            <td>ー</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>ー</td>\n                            <td>25.00%</td>\n                            <td>25.00%</td>\n                            <td>ー</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>6.25%</td>\n                            <td>25.00%</td>\n                            <td>25.00%</td>\n                            <td>ー</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>6.25%</td>\n                            <td>16.67%</td>\n                            <td>16.67%</td>\n                            <td>16.67%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                </small>\n            </div>\n\n\n            \n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination5\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-02-20\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    高確移行率</h3>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-02-20\">2024/02/20更新</div>\n                <p>有利区間へ入った直後やボーナス・ATを終えた後は、設定が高いほど高確を経由して始まりやすい仕組みです。</p>  \n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:25%;\">通常へ</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:25%;\">高確へ</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:25%;\">超高確へ</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>89.1%</td>\n                            <td>10.2%</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"5\">0.8%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>86.7%</td>\n                            <td>12.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>83.6%</td>\n                            <td>15.6%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>81.3%</td>\n                            <td>18.0%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>78.9%</td>\n                            <td>20.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination9\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-12-15\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    レア役成立時のボーナス当選率</h3>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-12-15\">2024/12/15更新</div>\n                <p>通常時にレア役が引けた際のボーナス当選率には、設定によって差がつけられています。</p>\n                <h4>小役グループの内訳</h4>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>グループ</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:75%;\">成立役</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>グループA</td>\n                            <td>弱チェリー</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>グループB</td>\n                            <td>ベル3連・リプレイ3連</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>グループC</td>\n                            <td>強チェリー・チャンス目・ベル4連・リプレイ4連・レア役2連(青CHANCE→青CHANCE・赤CHANCE→青CHANCE)</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>グループD</td>\n                            <td>レア役2連(青CHANCE→赤CHANCE)</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>グループE</td>\n                            <td>ベル5連・リプレイ5連・レア役3連・レア役2連(赤CHANCE→赤CHANCE・紫or金CHANCE→紫or金CHANCE・虹CHANCE)・リーチ目役</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <div class=\"memo\">\n                    <p> MEMO</p>                \n                    <p>グループEは状態にかかわらずボーナス濃厚となります。</p>\n                </div>\n                <h4>小役グループ別のボーナス当選率</h4>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>通常中</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:20%;\">グループA</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:20%;\">グループB</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:20%;\">グループC</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:20%;\">グループD</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>0.78%</td>\n                            <td>3.89%</td>\n                            <td>22.2%</td>\n                            <td>38.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>0.78%</td>\n                            <td>3.86%</td>\n                            <td>22.5%</td>\n                            <td>39.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>0.79%</td>\n                            <td>3.88%</td>\n                            <td>23.7%</td>\n                            <td>40.8%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>0.78%</td>\n                            <td>3.89%</td>\n                            <td>23.7%</td>\n                            <td>41.6%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>0.78%</td>\n                            <td>3.88%</td>\n                            <td>24.4%</td>\n                            <td>43.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>高確中</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:20%;\">グループA</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:20%;\">グループB</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:20%;\">グループC</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:20%;\">グループD</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>0.79%</td>\n                            <td>3.94%</td>\n                            <td>42.3%</td>\n                            <td>54.7%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>0.78%</td>\n                            <td>3.85%</td>\n                            <td>42.3%</td>\n                            <td>54.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>0.79%</td>\n                            <td>3.93%</td>\n                            <td>44.7%</td>\n                            <td>59.0%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>0.77%</td>\n                            <td>3.93%</td>\n                            <td>47.1%</td>\n                            <td>64.9%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>0.78%</td>\n                            <td>3.82%</td>\n                            <td>48.1%</td>\n                            <td>67.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>超高確中</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:20%;\">グループA</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:20%;\">グループB</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:20%;\">グループC</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:20%;\">グループD</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>0.80%</td>\n                            <td>3.6%</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"5\">100%</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"5\">100%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>0.85%</td>\n                            <td>4.0%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>0.84%</td>\n                            <td>3.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>0.77%</td>\n                            <td>4.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>0.78%</td>\n                            <td>4.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination6\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-02-20\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    CZ当選率</h3>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-02-20\">2024/02/20更新</div>\n                <p>スイカが成立したときのCZ「アスカvsレイ」への当選率は、設定が高いほど有利になります。</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>スイカ成立時のCZ当選率</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:50%;\">CZ当選率</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>20.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>21.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>25.0%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>27.7%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>30.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination7\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-02-20\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    スルー回数天井の減算抽選</h3>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-02-20\">2024/02/20更新</div>\n                <p>通常時にG侵食役を引いても状態変異が起こらなかった場合、スルー回数天井を減らす抽選が実施されます。</p>\n                <p>なお、高設定ほど減算当選率が優遇されています。</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:50%;\">減算当選率</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>4.7%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>7.8%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>10.9%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>11.7%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>12.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n\n            \n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination8\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-02-20\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    殲滅作戦中の抽選</h3>\n                <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-02-20\">2024/02/20更新</div>\n                <p>AT中の殲滅作戦の突入率と勝利期待度に設定差があります。</p>\n\n                <h4><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-02-20\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    殲滅作戦の突入率</h4>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-02-20\">2024/02/20更新</div>\n                <p>AT消化中にスイカが成立すると殲滅作戦の抽選を受けられ、その突入率は高設定ほど恵まれています。</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>スイカ成立時の殲滅作戦突入率</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:50%;\">突入率</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"2\">30.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"2\">37.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>39.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                \n                <h4><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-02-20\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    殲滅作戦の勝利期待度</h4>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-02-20\">2024/02/20更新</div>\n                <p>高設定ほど殲滅作戦の勝利期待度が優遇されています。</p>\n                <p>ちなみに勝利抽選は、突入時の分(設定差あり)と消化中に引いた成立役の分(全設定共通)とで振り分けられます。</p>\n                <p>(殲滅作戦について)</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:50%;\">勝利期待度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>49.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>50.4%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>51.7%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>52.9%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>65.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <div class=\"memo\">\n                    <p> MEMO</p>                \n                    <p>突入時の勝利抽選の詳細は調査中です。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">高設定狙いに必要な演出法則</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            </div>\n           \n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>","shukei":""}